35
00:02:10,607 --> 00:02:13,329
[SPEAKER_03]: But honestly, I still like going to stores.

36
00:02:13,830 --> 00:02:16,172
[SPEAKER_03]: I like to see the product with my own eyes.

37
00:02:16,927 --> 00:02:17,627
[SPEAKER_01]: That makes sense.

38
00:02:18,227 --> 00:02:22,129
[SPEAKER_01]: When you shop online, you can't really touch the product or try it.

39
00:02:22,589 --> 00:02:25,010
[SPEAKER_01]: But for me, the convenience is amazing.

40
00:02:25,290 --> 00:02:27,111
[SPEAKER_01]: I can buy something while sitting on my couch.

41
00:02:27,811 --> 00:02:28,131
[SPEAKER_03]: True.

42
00:02:28,651 --> 00:02:31,052
[SPEAKER_03]: Online shopping is definitely convenient.

43
00:02:31,532 --> 00:02:34,053
[SPEAKER_03]: Last week, I ordered a phone case online.

44
00:02:34,293 --> 00:02:35,593
[SPEAKER_03]: It took only two minutes.

45
00:02:36,114 --> 00:02:38,995
[SPEAKER_03]: But when it arrived, it looked different from the pictures.

46
00:02:39,795 --> 00:02:40,435
[SPEAKER_01]: Oh, no.

47
00:02:40,735 --> 00:02:41,756
[SPEAKER_01]: That happens sometimes.

48
00:02:42,196 --> 00:02:42,896
