51
00:02:51,683 --> 00:02:54,206
[SPEAKER_01]: That's one thing I don't like about online shopping.

52
00:02:54,486 --> 00:02:56,208
[SPEAKER_01]: Returning items can be annoying.

53
00:02:56,768 --> 00:02:59,270
